WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
12 years ago the virus qk12 began with the argentine destruction not only destroyed

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:14.040
bodies destroyed minds infected people lost all ability to think for themselves trapped

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:19.320
in a blindness that consumed them completely many chose to infect themselves with the virus

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:25.760
only for convenience and in exchange for benefits others were born without a future condemned from

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.760
from the beginning to an empty life.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.760
The country sank into chaos,

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:33.760
walking aimlessly and chasing ideals that took them to ruin.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.760
But not all were infected.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.760
Some resisted, hidden in the shadows,

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:43.760
waiting for the day when the virus could no longer infect.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:46.760
Although today QK12 remains present in many,

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:48.760
its power weakens.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:52.760
The disease continues but now it no longer infects, it has become vulnerable.

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:56.860
and in the midst of destruction a hope has arisen.
